<h3>2026-08-29 — Hermes Director+Coder process + per-branch model matrix in git</h3>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>What.</strong> Tracked <code>.hermes/director-coder.md</code> (shared todo work-order process) and <code>.hermes/models.md</code> (default coding stack + per-branch prefs, e.g. Documentation free-first). Root <code>.hermes.md</code> §6 points at both. Documentation worktree uses a thin branch <code>.hermes.md</code> that honors global + models row.</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Why.</strong> All branches need the Director+Coder process after merge; live API keys stay in <code>~/.hermes</code>; branches may differ on preferred models via matrix + optional <code>hermes -p</code> profiles.</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Files.</strong> <code>.hermes.md</code>, <code>.hermes/director-coder.md</code>, <code>.hermes/models.md</code>; Documentation worktree <code>.hermes.md</code>.</p>
